  "details": "Since the latest update, there's an issue related to stations (or maybe an issue related to avatars?), this issue can be tested in my \"Lightcycle Arena\" world https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_9157c81d-24fe-402d-8ba9-2e0ae6e15fa2\n\nand I was able to reproduce that issue with all avatars I've tested so far.\n\nExpected behavior : 1st picture (picture was taken way before that update)\n\nIssue is visible on the second pic.\n\n(It could be an issue related to avatars because that issue happened before with certain avatars, now it seems to happen with all avatars)",
